{
  "name": "Speek-It 2 - Unified AI Vocal Coach API",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuração obrigatória\n1. Abra cada nó OpenAI com alerta vermelho e selecione a mesma credencial OpenAI.\n2. Salve o workflow e clique em **Publish/Active**.\n3. No nó Webhook, copie a **Production URL** (não a Test URL).\n4. A URL final deve usar HTTPS e terminar em `/webhook/speek-it-api`.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, -260],
      "id": "setup-note",
      "name": "LEIA PRIMEIRO"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "speek-it-api",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-440, 160],
      "id": "webhook-entry",
      "name": "Webhook API Entry",
      "webhookId": "speek-it-api"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "evaluate-condition",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "evaluate",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "evaluate"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "chat-condition",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "chat",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "chat"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [-200, 160],
      "id": "action-router",
      "name": "Route Action"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://speek-it-whisper:9000/v1/audio/transcriptions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer speek-it-local-whisper"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "file",
              "inputDataFieldName": "audio"
            },
            {
              "name": "model",
              "value": "whisper-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "language",
              "value": "en"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [40, -100],
      "id": "transcribe-evaluation",
      "name": "OpenAI - Transcribe Evaluation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Texto alvo esperado:\n{{ $('Webhook API Entry').item.json.body.promptText }}\n\nTranscrição realizada pelo aluno:\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "Você é um especialista em fonética e pronúncia de inglês para brasileiros. Compare a transcrição com o texto alvo. Responda SOMENTE com JSON válido, sem markdown, usando exatamente este formato: {\"scoreFluency\":85,\"scorePronunciation\":78,\"scoreGrammar\":90,\"generalFeedback\":\"Resumo breve e encorajador em português.\",\"criticalWords\":[{\"word\":\"comfortable\",\"ipa\":\"/ˈkʌm.fɚ.t̬ə.bəl/\",\"tip\":\"Dica articulatória curta em português.\"}],\"initialCoachGreeting\":\"Saudação curta convidando o aluno a praticar os principais ajustes.\"}. Use notas inteiras de 0 a 100. Não invente erros quando a transcrição estiver correta."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [300, -100],
      "id": "evaluation-chain",
      "name": "Evaluate Pronunciation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "responseFormat": "json_object",
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [300, 60],
      "id": "evaluation-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model - Evaluation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $json.text ?? $json.output ?? $json.response ?? '{}';\nconst cleaned = typeof raw === 'string' ? raw.replace(/^```(?:json)?\\s*/i, '').replace(/\\s*```$/i, '').trim() : raw;\nlet result;\ntry {\n  result = typeof cleaned === 'string' ? JSON.parse(cleaned) : cleaned;\n} catch (error) {\n  throw new Error(`A avaliação da OpenAI não retornou JSON válido: ${String(raw).slice(0, 300)}`);\n}\nreturn [{ json: result }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [560, -100],
      "id": "parse-evaluation",
      "name": "Parse Evaluation JSON"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              },
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [800, -100],
      "id": "respond-evaluation",
      "name": "Respond Evaluation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "audio-exists",
              "leftValue": "={{ Boolean($binary?.audio) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [40, 300],
      "id": "chat-audio-check",
      "name": "Chat Has Audio?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "audio",
        "operation": "transcribe",
        "binaryPropertyName": "audio",
        "options": {
          "language": "en"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [280, 220],
      "id": "transcribe-chat",
      "name": "OpenAI - Transcribe Chat"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "chat-text-field",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $('Webhook API Entry').item.json.body.text }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [280, 380],
      "id": "prepare-text-chat",
      "name": "Prepare Text Chat"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://speek-it-ollama:11434/api/chat",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ {\n  model: 'qwen2.5:3b',\n  stream: false,\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: 'system',\n      content: 'Você é o treinador de pronúncia do Speek-It: caloroso, paciente e prático. Atenda usuários brasileiros e responda sempre em português do Brasil. Use inglês somente nas palavras, frases e exemplos que o aluno deve praticar, sempre acompanhados de explicação em português. Dê instruções curtas sobre língua, lábios, mandíbula, respiração, sílaba tônica e ritmo. Evite termos técnicos sem explicação. Limite a resposta a 120 palavras e termine com um exercício concreto ou uma pergunta curta para continuar a prática.'\n    },\n    {\n      role: 'user',\n      content: $json.text\n    }\n  ]\n} }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [540, 300],
      "id": "coach-chain",
      "name": "Vocal Coach Response"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.45
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [540, 480],
      "id": "coach-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model - Coach"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "audio",
        "operation": "textToSpeech",
        "text": "={{ $json.text ?? $json.output ?? $json.response }}",
        "options": {
          "voice": "alloy"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [800, 300],
      "id": "coach-tts",
      "name": "OpenAI - Coach Voice"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ {\n  textResponse: $json.message?.content ?? 'Não consegui preparar a resposta agora.',\n  audioBase64: null,\n  timestamp: $now.toISO()\n} }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              },
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [1040, 300],
      "id": "respond-chat",
      "name": "Respond Coach Chat"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={\"error\":\"Ação inválida. Use action=evaluate ou action=chat.\"}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [40, 560],
      "id": "respond-invalid-action",
      "name": "Respond Invalid Action"
    }
  ],
